WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.770
Whoever plays Jennifer Walters, a.k.a.

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:06.920
She-Hulk, needs to have a commanding presence
in the courtroom as well as in fight scenes,

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.740
and she also needs stellar comedic timing.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:13.040
Here are a few actors who would look great
in green for Marvel's Disney+ She-Hulk show.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:18.200
Gina Carano has had a long career in action
roles film fans probably knew Carano either

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:22.550
as the merciless henchwoman Angel Dust in
the first Deadpool movie or as one of Hobbs'

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.680
secret agents in Fast &amp; Furious 6.

00:00:25.089 --> 00:00:29.199
What makes Carano stand out as a potential
She-Hulk is her real-world experience in martial

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:29.700
arts.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.980
She started out competing in Muay Thai before
deciding to become an MMA fighter, winning

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.480
all but one of her bouts.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:39.880
Her martial arts background and muscular physique
would be great for She-Hulk's superhero battles,

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.720
and her bravado will work well during the
dialogue-heavy scenes.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.560
"What the hell happened?"

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.920
"We met Dom's girlfriend.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:47.840
She's lovely."

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:52.480
Recently, Carano has gained a whole new fanbase
thanks to her role as the mercenary Cara Dune

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:56.420
in The Mandalorian which also, as luck would
have it, airs on Disney+.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.520
Bringing her in to finally play a superhero
just makes sense.

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:04.379
Lena Headey spent eight years playing Cersei
Lannister, one of the most compelling antagonists

00:01:04.379 --> 00:01:05.379
in all of television.

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:09.520
Headey is only 5'5" in real life, but you
could never tell on Game of Thrones.

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:11.600
The actor is just that good at commanding
the room.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.560
Wouldn't it be great to see her bring that
commanding energy to a super-strong, super-green

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:16.060
lawyer?

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:20.740
As Cersei, she managed to balance her character's
truly human struggles with her ruthless climb

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.240
to power.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.620
The challenge of balancing Lawyer Jennifer
and Superhero Jennifer is tricky, but Headey

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:26.640
can definitely pull it off.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:31.060
It certainly doesn't hurt that she has previous
experience with action scenes in Terminator:

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:33.560
The Sarah Connor Chronicles and the Purge
series.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:37.380
Plus, it would be delightful to see Cersei
stare down the biggest bads of the Marvel

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:37.880
Universe.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.040
D'Arcy Carden is having a moment.

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:44.220
In addition to playing Janet, the helpful
celestial assistant on The Good Place, audiences

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:48.380
have also recently seen her on HBO's critically
acclaimed Bill Hader-led hit Barry.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:52.740
While cheery, personality-less Janet was very
funny in the first season, the rest of the

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:56.800
series shows how she slowly evolves into a
more complex and opinionated being.

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:00.320
Carden's versatility shines in every version
of Janet she portrays.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:04.860
"It turns out that the best Janet was the
Janet that was inside Janet all along."

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:09.160
She has a knack for bringing genuinely sincere
moments into her comedic roles, and not all

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.320
actors can pull that off.

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:14.660
A She-Hulk show would need that nuance to
avoid getting too serious or too silly.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.460
On top of her comedy background, Carden did
a little stunt work for The Good Place and

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:19.740
has said how much she loved it.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:24.610
As that series wraps up, this is the perfect
time to cast her in something more action-packed...

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:27.040
and a green super-powered lawyer sounds just
about right.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.420
Outside of television, Adrianne Palicki might
be best remembered as the cold, conniving

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:36.030
assassin Ms. Perkins in John Wick, but her
career is full of action roles, big and small.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:40.440
Her work in the sci-fi/comedy series The Orville
mixes action, humor, and science fiction.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:43.960
And with her 5'11" stature, Palicki seems
like a natural fit for She-Hulk.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.780
Palicki has already been a Marvel hero as
fan favorite Bobbi Morse on Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:52.080
But there is a precedent for actors to play
different superheroes, even in the same comic

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:52.880
universe.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:57.340
Brandon Routh joined the Arrowverse as the
Atom after his lead role in Superman Returns,

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:01.180
while Chris Evans and Michael B. Jordan, two
different Johnny Storm actors, both went on

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.280
to even bigger roles within the MCU.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:06.200
Who says Palicki can't be brought in to play
a different superhero?

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:09.160
Kathryn Hahn's body of work runs the gamut.

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:14.000
There's maniacal Olivia Octavius, a new take
on the classic Spider-Man villain Doc Ock,

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.220
in Into the Spider-Verse.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.750
Then there's the kind Rabbi Raquel Fein [FINE]
in the TV show Transparent.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:23.520
And recently she took on the title role on
HBO's Mrs. Fletcher, which explores the vulnerability

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.680
of being on your own after your kids leave
for college.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:26.580
"Oh.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:27.680
Breathe."

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:30.800
"Okay, but I think maybe you should listen
to the candle."

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:31.720
"Mm.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:32.700
I breathe."

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:37.080
The role proves Hahn can embody the hardworking
side of Jennifer Walters, who genuinely cares

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.100
about justice and defending her clients.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:43.100
However, a role that stands out above the
others for this fan-casting is the acerbic,

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:47.580
driven political consultant Jennifer Barkley
on Parks and Rec. Barkley was only on the

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.270
show periodically, but every appearance was
a treat.

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:54.520
Hahn portrayed Barkley as completely confident
and frank to a fault, and she can pull so

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:58.340
much from that scene-stealing role into the
sharp-tongued, career-driven Walters.

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:02.820
Fans have suggested that Aisha Tyler portray
Jennifer Walters for years.

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.960
At 6'0", Tyler is certainly already the height
to play She-Hulk.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:10.900
Voicing secret agent Lana Kane on the adult
animated series Archer, Tyler has also proven

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:14.780
she can play a career-driven woman who also
happens to fight bad guys and blow things

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:15.280
up.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:19.360
Tyler has been part of several talk show casts
and knows how to handle a room on her own,

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.900
much like Jennifer herself would.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:25.110
While her film and TV work is extensive, she
hasn't had a chance to lead her own show,

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.460
and this feels like the right fit.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.160
It doesn't hurt that Tyler is a self-professed
nerd, either.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.680
Imagine how hyped she'd be playing a superhero.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.640
In many ways, Laura Prepon's acting career
has always been tied to how tall she is.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:40.460
In her breakout role as Donna on That '70s
Show, one of the main running jokes was about

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.260
Donna towering over her boyfriend.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:47.069
It seems fitting for 5'10" Prepon to use that
height to her advantage in a role like She-Hulk,

00:04:47.069 --> 00:04:48.660
where it wouldn't be treated like a joke.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:53.400
On top of that, her smoky, droll voice is
perfect for the dialogue on a show like She-Hulk.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:54.960
"Nothing wrong with that."

00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:00.040
Prepon exhibits a cool confidence in her various
roles, and seeing her walk into a law office

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:04.500
with all the swagger of a super strong, beautiful,
brilliant lawyer would really work for this

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:05.000
character.

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:09.060
Since her time as felon Alex on Orange Is
the New Black is done, it would be fitting

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.500
for Prepon to jump to the other side of the
legal system.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:16.279
Like her co-star Lena Headey, Gwendoline Christie
is at an interesting point in her career.

00:05:16.279 --> 00:05:20.689
Her breakout role as Brienne of Tarth on Game
of Thrones won the hearts of millions of viewers,

00:05:20.689 --> 00:05:24.900
and yet her short time as Phasma in the new
Star Wars trilogy felt like wasted potential.

00:05:25.129 --> 00:05:29.180
Now that Game of Thrones is over, it's about
time she takes her experience with fight choreography

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:31.160
and jumps into another popular genre.

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:35.200
Christie is a funny, charismatic person in
real life, but she hasn't gotten to explore

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.380
that in her past roles.

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:41.680
Jennifer Walters would suit her strengths
to a T. And at 6'3", she's also the most physically

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.180
well-suited to play the character.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:47.379
It's easy to imagine what a blast Christie
would have in a big, funny role like this

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.060
and she would totally rock a pantsuit.

